==> What is a Loop and its usecase in Js with example? i mean why need loop?


--Array-> For-of loop

==> Explain While Loop and when we use for loop and when while loop? and how do we know which methods shuold be using?

let number = 0;
while(number<5){
    console.log("looping",number)
    number= number + 1;
}

let num = 1; //loop variable
while(num<=10){ //loop condition
    if(num%2==0){
        console.log("even num",num) //loop statement
    }
    num++; //loop variable change
}


